    "detailed_description": "<i>Exocide </i>is a retro FPS with an early 00's aesthetic. Manage two powerful sets of weapon systems with extreme aggression to annihilate the swarm! Keep your maniacal robotic backpack excited using a powerful array of weaponry.<br><br>- Mix and match ammunition types and weapons for bonuses and rewards.<br><br>- Manage your power reserves to find a balance between quick mobility and absurd firepower.  <br><br>- Go in for the kill with fast paced gory melee combat.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678350/extras/d69370c40408b1971a017921e1086ba5.poster.avif?t=1680304210\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678350/extras/d69370c40408b1971a017921e1086ba5.webm?t=1680304210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678350/extras/d69370c40408b1971a017921e1086ba5.mp4?t=1680304210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Years ago, several nations deployed giant combat-modified insects to aid in The Great War. This swarm of insects eventually turned in search of a food source to sustain their growing population. A decade of human genocide has wiped out most of the population. The remaining survivors have consolidated into a single fortified colony to fight extinction.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678350/extras/1027ba7575a93427ea58e6c360405792.poster.avif?t=1680304210\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678350/extras/1027ba7575a93427ea58e6c360405792.webm?t=1680304210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678350/extras/1027ba7575a93427ea58e6c360405792.mp4?t=1680304210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br> You are the last living member of the Handlers, a highly trained special forces group that was originally tasked with raising and fighting alongside these giant insects during The Great War.",
    "about_the_game": "<i>Exocide </i>is a retro FPS with an early 00's aesthetic. Manage two powerful sets of weapon systems with extreme aggression to annihilate the swarm! Keep your maniacal robotic backpack excited using a powerful array of weaponry.<br><br>- Mix and match ammunition types and weapons for bonuses and rewards.<br><br>- Manage your power reserves to find a balance between quick mobility and absurd firepower.  <br><br>- Go in for the kill with fast paced gory melee combat.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678350/extras/d69370c40408b1971a017921e1086ba5.poster.avif?t=1680304210\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678350/extras/d69370c40408b1971a017921e1086ba5.webm?t=1680304210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678350/extras/d69370c40408b1971a017921e1086ba5.mp4?t=1680304210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Years ago, several nations deployed giant combat-modified insects to aid in The Great War. This swarm of insects eventually turned in search of a food source to sustain their growing population. A decade of human genocide has wiped out most of the population. The remaining survivors have consolidated into a single fortified colony to fight extinction.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678350/extras/1027ba7575a93427ea58e6c360405792.poster.avif?t=1680304210\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678350/extras/1027ba7575a93427ea58e6c360405792.webm?t=1680304210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678350/extras/1027ba7575a93427ea58e6c360405792.mp4?t=1680304210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br> You are the last living member of the Handlers, a highly trained special forces group that was originally tasked with raising and fighting alongside these giant insects during The Great War.",
    "short_description": "Exocide from Apogee (Duke, Turbo, Prey, Max). Humans made superbugs to fight as soldiers. And the bugs turned against us. You're the last Handler, a human+AI robotic team with 4 total arms capable of welding 4 weapons, or one HUGE gun. Stop the super swarms before total human extinction.",
